1
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,670
[whimpering]

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,880
♪

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,890
- Oh, Kazuma!
- I'm Kazuma!

4
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:13,720
Death's icy grip
should not have taken thee!

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,980
You're enjoying this, huh?

6
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,940
I've always wanted to say that.

7
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,310
- [AQUA] Kazuma!
- I'm Kazuma!

8
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,690
[AQUA]
I'm done reviving your body,

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,570
so you think you could
hurry it up a little?

10
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:26,280
Darkness is really stinky
and depressed for some reason!

11
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,450
Now, stop wasting time
and let's go!

12
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:30,110
You need to get moving!
Come on!

13
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,570
[both chuckle]

14
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,740
- [gasps]
- [chuckles]

15
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:37,250
That's better.
Welcome home, Kazuma.

16
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,210
What is that nasty smell?

17
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,210
And how did I end up naked?

18
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,460
All your clothes were digested.

19
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,050
Your sword with the weird name

20
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:47,010
is the only thing
that's left here.

21
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:48,010
Hang on.

22
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:49,420
There is nothing "weird"
about the name

23
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:51,470
of that blade and, no,
I'm not just saying that

24
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:52,930
'cause I came up with it!

25
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:54,760
♪

26
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:57,180
Hey, Darkness.
Eris mentioned something.

27
00:00:57,890 --> 00:00:59,390
Did you really
let the Hydra swallow

28
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:00,850
you up to rescue me?

29
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,480
Hmm.

30
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,570
Doesn't sound like you at all.

31
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,280
♪

32
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,660
Well, let's head home
and hit the bath!

33
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:12,240
- Y' know, Kazuma.
- [KAZUMA] Hmm?

34
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,620
Asking her to do that
while you aren't

35
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,450
wearing any clothes
isn't the best look.

36
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,540
- [MEGUMIN] Are you a pervert?
- [gasps]

37
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:20,120
Are you a pervert?

38
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:52,840
All right,
it's time for you two

39
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,470
to get in the bath fast

40
00:02:54,670 --> 00:02:57,390
especially since Kazuma's gonna
get reported, at this rate.

41
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:58,720
Shut up!

42
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:00,680
Is the Hydra
still gonna be a problem?

43
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,060
Well, not for a while, anyway.

44
00:03:03,140 --> 00:03:05,230
It'll probably be tied up
re-fouling the lake.

45
00:03:05,690 --> 00:03:07,860
All thanks to me,
the Goddess who purified it!

46
00:03:08,230 --> 00:03:09,820
[MEGUMIN] Whenever you seem
sure of something,

47
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:12,190
it feels like there's a pitfall
that's lying in wait.

48
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,860
[scoffs]
Oh, really? Unbelievable!

49
00:03:14,990 --> 00:03:16,070
Keep on talking like that

50
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,370
and I'm gonna have Kazuma
or Darkness carry you instead!

51
00:03:18,450 --> 00:03:20,200
[whimpering]
Uh, no! I apologize, okay?

52
00:03:20,330 --> 00:03:21,740
Please! Anything but that!

53
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,370
[AQUA]
We need to get going, then.

54
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:24,620
We've gotta try and talk up

55
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:26,330
what we did out there
as best as we can!

56
00:03:26,790 --> 00:03:28,670
That way, even if we
don't get the full reward

57
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,920
for taking that monster down,

58
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,550
we could still get our grubby
little hands on some gold!

59
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,210
[MEGUMIN]
Leave everything to me!

60
00:03:34,460 --> 00:03:36,510
The glorious wonders
of my explosion magic

61
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:38,890
are something I can go into
great detail about!

62
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:43,560
[sighs]

63
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:46,230
[KAZUMA] According
to Aqua being digested

64
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:49,730
by the Hydra turned me into
more of a "Kazuma-chan."

65
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,270
Uh.

66
00:03:53,690 --> 00:03:56,820
Oh, man, this is the same size
it was before, right?

67
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,780
- [DARKNESS] Kazuma.
- Yeah? I'm Kazuma-chan?"

68
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:01,280
[DARKNESS]
You seem to be taking a while.

69
00:04:01,490 --> 00:04:04,120
- Are you hurt anywhere?
- No, no, I'm okay!

70
00:04:04,290 --> 00:04:05,790
[KAZUMA]
You remember how bad we stunk!

71
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,920
Just wanted to scrub
every itch.

72
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:09,290
[water splashing]

73
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:13,710
Just so you know, I, I regret
forcing the issue this time.

74
00:04:14,050 --> 00:04:15,760
Yeah, well,
what's done is done!

75
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,760
Aqua and Megumin
are probably chowing down

76
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:19,840
at the guild now,

77
00:04:20,050 --> 00:04:21,760
so we ought to hurry on
over there.

78
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:24,350
Indeed, we should get going.

79
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:26,430
Huh?

80
00:04:29,150 --> 00:04:31,650
[DARKNESS] I will leave your
change of clothes here for you.

81
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,320
[KAZUMA]
Hey, uh, is there some reason

82
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,240
you needed to take
that Hydra down?

83
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:38,780
[gasps]
No, no, not at all!

84
00:04:38,910 --> 00:04:40,610
- I mean, how could there be?
- [KAZUMA] So, there is.

85
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:42,070
- That's so weird to ask.
- [KAZUMA] I know it didn't

86
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,240
exactly work out today,

87
00:04:43,370 --> 00:04:44,910
but the next time
we go after that thing,

88
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:46,620
we'll come up
with a legit plan first.

89
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:47,910
- Okay?
- [Darkness gasps]

90
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:49,410
What's the matter with you?

91
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:51,210
After all that hot air
you kept on blowing

92
00:04:51,290 --> 00:04:52,630
about protecting the town

93
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,380
you aren't giving up already, right?

94
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:57,260
Never! It seems
you have forgotten who I am!

95
00:04:57,550 --> 00:04:59,220
As per my Dustiness bloodline

96
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:01,220
it is my sworn duty
to defend others.

97
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:04,060
So, the next chance we get,
that Hydra is dead meat!

98
00:05:04,390 --> 00:05:06,100
- [DARKNESS] Hmm?
- Hmm.

99
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:09,600
[MORGAN]
I can't believe this!

100
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:12,650
How do you people always manage
to make things worse?

101
00:05:12,860 --> 00:05:15,980
You guys just had to piss off
something as nasty as a Hydra!

102
00:05:16,070 --> 00:05:17,690
[YUNYUN]
Oh, my goodness, Megumin!

103
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:18,780
This sounds awful!

104
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,280
- What did you do this time?
- Hmm?

105
00:05:21,030 --> 00:05:22,950
- [tavern patrons complaining]
- [whimpering]

106
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:24,570
[gasps]
Kazuma!

107
00:05:25,410 --> 00:05:27,040
What's got 'em all so riled up?

108
00:05:27,290 --> 00:05:29,580
Since a squadron of knights
was being deployed

109
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:32,420
I thought the quest was posted
as a stopgap measure.

110
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:33,750
[chuckles]
About that.

111
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,460
Seems there's been
a bit of an incident

112
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:36,750
in the Royal Capital.

113
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,050
The Capital?

114
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,260
[IRIS]
Big Brother!

115
00:05:40,970 --> 00:05:42,840
Now tell me!
Is the Capital in trouble?

116
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:45,510
Is my cute little sister
in some kinda danger right now?

117
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:48,680
Well, apparently some group
calling themselves

118
00:05:48,770 --> 00:05:50,020
the Silver-Haired Thief Brigade

119
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,940
managed to sneak
into the Royal Castle.

120
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,310
[LUNA] And the knights
all have their hands full

121
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,650
trying to recover the treasures
that were stolen.

122
00:05:56,730 --> 00:05:58,190
♪

123
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,530
[KAZUMA]
Holy crap.

124
00:06:00,740 --> 00:06:03,910
I've got a bounty on my head
like a Devil King general.

125
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,780
Wait a minute,
if some capital city crooks

126
00:06:05,870 --> 00:06:08,200
have their bounties posted
in our town then...

127
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:10,160
Okay,
you didn't hear this from me

128
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:13,540
but the authorities consulted
a Crimson Demon fortune teller

129
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:15,170
about their true identities.

130
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:17,130
[LUNA]
And that 200 million bounty

131
00:06:17,210 --> 00:06:19,300
is hiding right under our noses
here in Axel!

132
00:06:19,590 --> 00:06:22,010
- [both gasp]
- [ALL] 200 mill?

133
00:06:22,090 --> 00:06:23,470
Hey, are you serious?

134
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:26,300
'Cause that's a lot juicier
than taking down some monsters!

135
00:06:26,890 --> 00:06:28,930
So, the Silver-Haired
Thief Brigade

136
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:31,270
is actually here in this town,
as we speak?

137
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,600
- [whimpering]
- Interesting.

138
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,310
200 million, huh?

139
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,730
[both whimpering]

140
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:38,520
Huh! Hey, come on!
What're you looking at me for?

141
00:06:39,150 --> 00:06:41,240
[LUNA] Everyone!
If we're able to capture

142
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,610
the Silver-Haired
Thief Brigade,

143
00:06:42,690 --> 00:06:45,280
then the knights will come to
Axel and deal with the Hydra!

144
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,740
So, with that being the case

145
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:49,290
we'll be expecting you to help,
as well, Kazuma!

146
00:06:51,410 --> 00:06:54,330
Sure! Of course! No problem!
I'd love to help out!

147
00:06:54,660 --> 00:06:55,670
[ALL]
Konosuba!

148
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:58,630
[AQUA] ♪ Little dragon
calm and serene ♪

149
00:06:58,710 --> 00:06:59,920
[KAZUMA]
And, of course, I decided

150
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,210
- to stay locked indoors.
- ♪ Go to sleep ♪

151
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:03,340
♪ and have a sweet dream ♪

152
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,300
♪ When you're born ♪

153
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:07,300
♪ My wish will come true ♪

154
00:07:07,890 --> 00:07:09,220
♪ I'll take care of you ♪

155
00:07:09,310 --> 00:07:10,640
[KAZUMA]
What's with the lullaby?

156
00:07:10,970 --> 00:07:12,270
Prenatal bonding!

157
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:13,640
Right!

158
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,690
You don't have to lie beside
the egg like that, ya know.

159
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:19,110
Leaving it there by
the fireplace should be fine.

160
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:21,400
And if it ends up cooked,
we can always eat it.

161
00:07:21,570 --> 00:07:23,190
[grunts]
You seem kinda hungry!

162
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,490
So why don't you try
a holy knuckle sandwich?

163
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:27,860
I'm channeling my powers
into the egg!

164
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,280
And that way, I can make sure

165
00:07:29,370 --> 00:07:30,990
he'll reign over
all the other dragons!

166
00:07:31,450 --> 00:07:34,120
As his mom I'll do
whatever I can to help him!

167
00:07:34,290 --> 00:07:35,870
Then again,
you already know that,

168
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,830
now don't you my Emperor Zel?

169
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:40,380
[KAZUMA] That has gotta be
the stupidest name.

170
00:07:40,750 --> 00:07:42,630
Kazuma! It's go time!

171
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,670
If the Hydra won't fall
from a single blow,

172
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:47,090
then we'll continue
to strike away until it does!

173
00:07:47,260 --> 00:07:48,050
Huh?

174
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:50,050
[MEGUMIN] As with
the Mobile Fortress Destroyer,

175
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:51,930
Aqua's magic power
and your drain touch

176
00:07:52,010 --> 00:07:53,850
are what we need
to take it down for good!

177
00:07:54,230 --> 00:07:55,850
- Yeah, no.
- [gasps]

178
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,480
Why should I head out there
and fight this thing

179
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:00,730
by submitting to some
disgusting Lich skill?

180
00:08:01,070 --> 00:08:02,770
My holy magic power
isn't meant to be

181
00:08:02,860 --> 00:08:05,240
shared with everyone
at the drop of a hat, ya know!

182
00:08:05,530 --> 00:08:07,070
I don't care
if Kazuma threatens me,

183
00:08:07,150 --> 00:08:08,410
if Darkness
tries buttering me up,

184
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:10,030
or if you go totally crazy,
Megumin,

185
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,490
'cause I'm not gonna do it!

186
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:12,740
[gasps]

187
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,370
[KAZUMA]
What is up with you?

188
00:08:14,450 --> 00:08:16,620
Why are you so fired up
for revenge, anyway?

189
00:08:16,750 --> 00:08:19,790
Uh. It's simple.

190
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,920
This is the same monster
that took your life.

191
00:08:22,210 --> 00:08:24,380
So, why wouldn't I want to try
and avenge that?

192
00:08:25,710 --> 00:08:27,260
I...I see.

193
00:08:29,550 --> 00:08:31,100
[MEGUMIN] Up to this point,
we've been using

194
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:32,890
Darkness' Decoy skill
every day,

195
00:08:33,010 --> 00:08:34,310
and then
we always follow that up

196
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:36,560
with a blast of Explosion Magic
to harass it.

197
00:08:36,890 --> 00:08:37,980
But, I'm still wondering

198
00:08:38,060 --> 00:08:40,230
if there isn't
a more effective strategy.

199
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,520
What the hell, Darkness?
You didn't say anything?

200
00:08:42,770 --> 00:08:44,860
It's your job to stop her
when she gets like this!

201
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,240
W-Well, sometimes...

202
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:48,820
but it is quite important
that The Hydra is dealt with.

203
00:08:48,990 --> 00:08:51,070
And, besides this should be
fairly effective

204
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,080
at whittling down
its magical power.

205
00:08:53,990 --> 00:08:55,370
[KAZUMA]
These two.

206
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:58,120
We're outta luck
as long as it keeps raining.

207
00:08:58,250 --> 00:09:00,040
That just gives the thing
an advantage.

208
00:09:00,420 --> 00:09:01,540
The fortune tellers say

209
00:09:01,620 --> 00:09:04,250
this rain isn't going to be
letting up any time soon.

210
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:06,880
I'll get serious
when the sun comes out.

211
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,340
[both gasp]

212
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:11,090
- [cat meowing]
- [gasps]

213
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,970
So, you weren't going to do
anything about this

214
00:09:13,050 --> 00:09:14,550
in the foreseeable future?

215
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,350
[KAZUMA] What the hell?
Give her back to me!

216
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,180
I need my Chomusuke!
Put her down!

217
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:21,190
You got that? Gimme the cat
or face the consequences!

218
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,270
♪

219
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:26,610
[explosion]

220
00:09:29,490 --> 00:09:30,700
[Megumin fainting]

221
00:09:32,450 --> 00:09:33,570
[KAZUMA]
In the days that followed,

222
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:35,120
the rain still didn't let up.

223
00:09:35,410 --> 00:09:37,950
But, that didn't stop
Darkness and Megumin.

224
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,830
They just kept on paying visits
to the Hydra.

225
00:09:41,290 --> 00:09:42,420
[MEGUMIN]
Hey, we're home!

226
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:43,670
Darkness is a bit of a mess,

227
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:45,630
so could you get
the bath ready for her?

228
00:09:46,090 --> 00:09:47,880
[Darkness panting]

229
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:49,670
[KAZUMA] Seriously,
you've gotta stop this.

230
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:50,800
It's dangerous.

231
00:09:51,510 --> 00:09:52,590
That monster.

232
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:55,050
It must be bothered
by all the Explosion magic

233
00:09:55,350 --> 00:09:56,560
because it ambushed us.

234
00:09:57,310 --> 00:09:58,640
[DARKNESS]
Megumin landed her spell,

235
00:09:58,970 --> 00:10:00,230
which gave us
the chance to flee

236
00:10:00,310 --> 00:10:01,640
while it was regenerating.

237
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:05,980
This is proving to be
much harder than I thought.

238
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,570
Thanks so much, Aqua.

239
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:09,360
- [AQUA] Mm-hmm.
- Uh!

240
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:13,450
♪

241
00:10:13,610 --> 00:10:15,160
[growling]

242
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:24,920
[sighs]

243
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:32,550
♪ My sweet dragon
so safe and warm ♪

244
00:10:32,970 --> 00:10:36,350
♪ I can't wait
until you are born ♪

245
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:40,770
♪ Mother's here
for all that you do ♪

246
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:43,060
[DARKNESS]
Kazuma. What are you doing?

247
00:10:43,230 --> 00:10:45,230
Got pretty bored,
so I'm fixing your armor.

248
00:10:45,850 --> 00:10:47,230
There's really nothing' else
to do here,

249
00:10:47,310 --> 00:10:48,570
with all this rain.

250
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,780
You better not run out there
when I'm done, either.

251
00:10:52,940 --> 00:10:54,070
Hmm.

252
00:10:55,070 --> 00:10:56,200
This reminds me.

253
00:10:56,490 --> 00:10:58,240
You repaired my armor
once before

254
00:10:58,370 --> 00:11:00,410
back when we were on our way
to the hot springs.

255
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:03,370
You know we should all
go there again, sometime.

256
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:05,920
There's no way in hell.
I can't stand that place.

257
00:11:06,170 --> 00:11:08,250
It feels like a whole town
full of Megumins.

258
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:09,840
[MEGUMIN]
Hey, and what exactly

259
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,550
is that supposed to mean, anyway?

260
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,260
Excuse me? Come on!

261
00:11:13,340 --> 00:11:15,470
How could you be so cruel
to my adoring faithful?

262
00:11:15,630 --> 00:11:16,760
You, too, Aqua?

263
00:11:16,970 --> 00:11:18,970
Guess I'm confused, so maybe
you can explain this!

264
00:11:19,050 --> 00:11:20,850
I just mean that my faithful
are really sweet

265
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:21,930
and earnest types!

266
00:11:22,270 --> 00:11:25,640
Even so going would be nice.

267
00:11:27,770 --> 00:11:29,440
[birds chirping]

268
00:11:30,570 --> 00:11:32,360
Kazuma!
Darkness has gone missing!

269
00:11:32,570 --> 00:11:34,190
And her equipment isn't here,
either!

270
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:37,660
[KAZUMA] Dammit! I kept on
tellin' her not to go!

271
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,740
It's too dangerous to do alone!

272
00:11:39,910 --> 00:11:42,540
Unbelievable!
That girl is so unbelievable!

273
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,870
First, I'm gonna drop off
the egg with Wiz,

274
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,920
then I'll give Darkness
a piece of my mind!

275
00:11:48,380 --> 00:11:51,460
[sighs]
All right!

276
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:53,090
The two of you
need to go on ahead

277
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:55,510
- and try to slow her down!
- You're leaving?

278
00:11:55,970 --> 00:11:57,720
I've gotta head out
and make a few stops!

279
00:11:57,930 --> 00:12:00,140
No matter what, do not
let her fight by herself!

280
00:12:00,890 --> 00:12:04,850
Damn it, Darkness!
I guess we're doin' this!

281
00:12:07,310 --> 00:12:08,520
[roughneck sighs]

282
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:10,980
I don't like the look
of that sky.

283
00:12:12,150 --> 00:12:14,110
It's making
all my old scars ache.

284
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:17,400
[DARKNESS]
Let go of me!

285
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:20,570
Unbelievable!
You're being so unbelievable!

286
00:12:20,740 --> 00:12:22,030
It's too dangerous to do alone!

287
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,990
Wait, is the reason
you aren't giving up

288
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,540
'cause you think
we're gonna yell at you?

289
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:27,960
We won't get mad!
Just come back home! Please!

290
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,870
What in the world's gotten
into you?

291
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,590
Tell us what's going on,
Darkness!

292
00:12:31,670 --> 00:12:32,880
I thought we were friends!

293
00:12:33,170 --> 00:12:36,010
[DARKNESS] That may be true
but, even so, I...

294
00:12:36,970 --> 00:12:38,050
Uh.

295
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:40,930
- [CROWD] Darkness!
- [gasps]

296
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:44,600
[crowd chanting Darkness!]

297
00:12:47,140 --> 00:12:48,520
[MAN 01]
Trying to get away, huh?

298
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:50,400
What the...

299
00:12:50,850 --> 00:12:53,150
[ALL]
Lalatina!

300
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,530
Hey, do not call me that!

301
00:12:55,860 --> 00:12:56,990
[DARKNESS]
What is going on here?

302
00:12:57,070 --> 00:12:58,650
If this is some new type
of harassment,

303
00:12:58,740 --> 00:13:00,070
I will not put up with it!

304
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,660
No, no, you don't understand!

305
00:13:01,740 --> 00:13:03,120
It's nothing like that!
I swear!

306
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,200
I was just telling everybody

307
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,490
how you kept fighting
the Hydra,

308
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:07,290
and asked 'em if they wanted
to try and help out!

309
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,670
Kazuma has really been keeping

310
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:11,330
the booze flowing for us, lately.

311
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:13,340
So, we figured we oughta
return the favor

312
00:13:13,540 --> 00:13:14,960
and pay the lad back a little.

313
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:16,300
And, we can help take care

314
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:18,090
of your issue
while we're at it, Lalatina.

315
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:21,590
[sighs]
See there? Check it out.

316
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:24,100
[KAZUMA] All of these
hardcore adventurers

317
00:13:24,180 --> 00:13:26,220
have gathered together out
here for you.

318
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:28,310
And, I know you've got
muscles for brains

319
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:30,940
but try your best not to
make 'em worry, all right?

320
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:33,020
Everyone...

321
00:13:33,690 --> 00:13:36,230
Hey, get a load of that!
Lalatina's embarrassed!

322
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,530
Ha-ha!

323
00:13:41,490 --> 00:13:42,610
[AQUA]
Blessing!

324
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:45,410
Blessing!
And even more Blessings!

325
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:49,500
If you're in the thief class,
then get ready with Bind!

326
00:13:49,660 --> 00:13:52,330
Archers, set up your roped
arrows and standby!

327
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:54,790
We're taking on a Hydra!
So, stay focused

328
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:56,090
[ADVENTURERS]
Right!

329
00:13:56,550 --> 00:13:58,960
Wizards, no need to worry
about a second shot!

330
00:13:59,170 --> 00:14:00,880
Just give us
all your magic power

331
00:14:00,970 --> 00:14:02,680
and be prepared for a big one!

332
00:14:03,260 --> 00:14:04,300
Leave it to me!

333
00:14:04,430 --> 00:14:06,680
My Explosion magic
is about to turn that Hydra

334
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,810
into a big pile
of burning cinders!

335
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,060
Now listen, Darkness!

336
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:14,190
Your Decoy skill is the key
to this entire plan!

337
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:16,150
So don't go down too fast!

338
00:14:16,690 --> 00:14:17,730
Right!

339
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,320
Okay.

340
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:21,240
Let's go!

341
00:14:21,650 --> 00:14:23,150
♪

342
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:26,240
[AQUA]
Blessing! Blessing! Blessing!

343
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,530
Blessing! Blessing! Blessing!

344
00:14:27,790 --> 00:14:28,950
Now, Darkness!

345
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,580
Consider it good as done!

346
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:33,000
Decoy!

347
00:14:34,670 --> 00:14:35,880
You're dead meat!

348
00:14:36,130 --> 00:14:38,090
[howling]

349
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:43,720
Aah!

350
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:46,720
[panting]

351
00:14:48,810 --> 00:14:51,220
[KAZUMA]
Good! Thief skill squad!

352
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:52,770
[THIEVES]
And Bind!

353
00:14:56,770 --> 00:15:00,110
Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!

354
00:15:00,230 --> 00:15:02,320
[panting]

355
00:15:10,410 --> 00:15:11,410
[ARCHER 08-A]
Wind speed's good.

356
00:15:11,500 --> 00:15:12,500
So's the line of sight.

357
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:14,620
All right,
just a little higher!

358
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:16,580
Good, good, good,
good, good, good.

359
00:15:16,790 --> 00:15:19,000
Okay, right there! Stop!

360
00:15:19,290 --> 00:15:20,550
Fire!

361
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,340
[gasps]

362
00:15:28,430 --> 00:15:29,640
[SAKAMAKI]
We got 'em!

363
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,470
- Hurry! Grab on!
- Pull! Pull!

364
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,850
Pull that thing!
Give it all that you've got!

365
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:35,560
[ADVENTURERS]
Heave Ho!

366
00:15:35,810 --> 00:15:37,650
[Hydra growling]

367
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:42,110
Are you sure about this,
Kazuma?

368
00:15:42,530 --> 00:15:44,650
Yeah, send me
right at that thing!

369
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:47,700
Ah! Aah!

370
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:55,000
[grunts]

371
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,710
If this monster won't go down
till its power's gone,

372
00:15:57,790 --> 00:15:58,880
then I'll take it all!

373
00:15:59,170 --> 00:16:01,380
[KAZUMA]
Drain Touch!

374
00:16:01,750 --> 00:16:03,710
♪

375
00:16:04,170 --> 00:16:06,010
[roaring]

376
00:16:07,930 --> 00:16:11,680
We can't lose!
It's working, you guys!

377
00:16:11,810 --> 00:16:13,010
Aah!

378
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:16,600
[thuds]

379
00:16:18,190 --> 00:16:20,520
[screaming] Good job!
We've got him now!

380
00:16:22,230 --> 00:16:23,530
[DARKNESS]
Kazuma!

381
00:16:24,280 --> 00:16:26,240
[Kazuma whimpering]

382
00:16:30,070 --> 00:16:31,410
Everyone!

383
00:16:32,830 --> 00:16:35,540
[growling]

384
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:37,790
[Kazuma whimpering]

385
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:40,210
[KAZUMA]
I'm impressed, Dustiness.

386
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:43,040
Look at all that strength
and endurance you've got.

387
00:16:43,250 --> 00:16:44,840
Now would not be the time!

388
00:16:45,090 --> 00:16:47,970
[DARKNESS] [groaning] I cannot
hold out for much longer.

389
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:50,550
[KAZUMA] Hang in there,
dumbass! You have to!

390
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:54,890
Drain Touch! Drain Touch!

391
00:16:55,010 --> 00:16:56,770
Darkness has really
taken a beating

392
00:16:56,850 --> 00:16:58,980
to chip away
at this thing's magic power.

393
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:00,980
And, I won't
let it go to waste!

394
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:04,110
Don't give up, Darkness,
we need you to keep going.

395
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:05,190
This is too much.

396
00:17:05,270 --> 00:17:06,940
Damn it, you're finally being
useful for once

397
00:17:07,030 --> 00:17:08,150
and you're giving up already?

398
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:10,530
I thought you were a hell
of a lot stronger than that!

399
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:12,910
- [gasps]
- Gimme a break!

400
00:17:12,990 --> 00:17:14,700
No way you'll win
an endurance contest

401
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:16,080
like this being so soft!

402
00:17:16,330 --> 00:17:17,830
Ya gutless wimp!

403
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:19,830
Being pulverized by a Hydra

404
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:21,960
while taking
a creep's verbal abuse.

405
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:26,130
This is absolutely
exhilarating!

406
00:17:26,710 --> 00:17:27,840
- Heave Ho! Heave Ho!
- Pull harder!

407
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,510
She can't take much more!

408
00:17:29,630 --> 00:17:32,550
Don't screw with Axel's
adventurers, scale face!

409
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,220
[grunts]
The others.

410
00:17:34,850 --> 00:17:38,600
Kazuma go not worry.
We will die together.

411
00:17:38,930 --> 00:17:41,480
I am very worried!
Stop giving up!

412
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:43,230
You'd never die
from having a Hydra

413
00:17:43,310 --> 00:17:44,520
flopping on top of you!

414
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:46,020
[KAZUMA] I'm the only one
who's gonna get

415
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:47,190
smooshed to death here!

416
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:48,570
[gasps]

417
00:17:49,990 --> 00:17:51,320
[DARKNESS]
If I give up right now,

418
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,070
then Kazuma will die?

419
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:57,120
[DARKNESS] [whimpering]
What is this?

420
00:17:57,370 --> 00:17:59,830
[whimpering]

421
00:18:00,830 --> 00:18:02,790
I have never felt
this way before.

422
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,710
You are ordering me around
as if you were my master.

423
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:08,130
Yet, your very life
is in my hands!

424
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:09,340
What a paradox.

425
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:11,380
That is such
a bold contradiction!

426
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:13,840
[whimpering]
So, in this situation,

427
00:18:13,930 --> 00:18:15,720
which one of us
is truly the master?

428
00:18:16,300 --> 00:18:19,060
Kazuma what novel stimulation!

429
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:22,560
[screaming]

430
00:18:23,390 --> 00:18:24,810
[Hydra groaning]

431
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:28,570
It looks like the hydra's
getting weaker!

432
00:18:28,650 --> 00:18:29,780
- [laughs]
- [gasps]

433
00:18:30,070 --> 00:18:32,320
I'm gonna collect that big-time
bounty, you guys!

434
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,740
The reward goes
to whoever lands

435
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:35,320
the finishing blow, remember?

436
00:18:35,410 --> 00:18:37,370
What the hell are you saying
at a time like this?

437
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:38,990
Nobody's getting
a cut of my loo--

438
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,830
[RIN]
No! Dust!

439
00:18:42,330 --> 00:18:43,580
[Kazuma groaning]

440
00:18:43,710 --> 00:18:47,250
Light of Saber!

441
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:50,760
Look do you see that?

442
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:52,840
Its head isn't growing back!

443
00:18:53,590 --> 00:18:56,140
All right, wizards!
Time to do your thing!

444
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:58,100
[MEGUMIN]
A looming tide of sorrows.

445
00:18:58,430 --> 00:19:01,560
An overflowing swell of screams
coiling into one another

446
00:19:01,850 --> 00:19:04,640
forming the howling vortex
that marks our victory!

447
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:08,440
Let the signal of Oblivion
now descend upon you!

448
00:19:09,610 --> 00:19:11,280
This is my offering
to the deceased.

449
00:19:11,610 --> 00:19:13,440
May he rest in eternal peace.

450
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:16,200
Vengeance for Kazuma!

451
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:17,950
[KAZUMA]
Hey, I'm still alive!

452
00:19:19,030 --> 00:19:21,910
[MEGUMIN]
Explosion!

453
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:25,540
[explosion]

454
00:19:30,210 --> 00:19:32,840
[tavern patrons cheering]

455
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,970
[indistinct chatter]

456
00:19:35,170 --> 00:19:36,890
It's pretty crazy
what you can pull off

457
00:19:36,970 --> 00:19:38,180
when you get desperate,
isn't it?

458
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:40,640
Hey, Kazuma, you guys
can take a bigger cut!

459
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:42,350
For trying to cheat everyone

460
00:19:42,430 --> 00:19:44,270
take this jerk's
cut of the reward too.

461
00:19:44,390 --> 00:19:46,140
- Huh?
- [laughs]

462
00:19:47,150 --> 00:19:48,350
How does it feel
to have finally

463
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:49,610
taken down that Hydra?

464
00:19:50,150 --> 00:19:51,520
Think you'll be able
to sleep better?

465
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:55,490
Yes, and I have
a whole new perspective, now.

466
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:57,820
So many things
that used to trouble me

467
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,910
seem so foolish, in hindsight.

468
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,410
[DARKNESS]
But, it has nothing

469
00:20:02,490 --> 00:20:04,290
to do with the Hydra
being destroyed.

470
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:06,080
Actually, I was just reminded

471
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:08,540
of how special the people
in this town are to me

472
00:20:09,130 --> 00:20:10,920
and how much I truly love them.

473
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:13,130
I have no more doubts
about that.

474
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:16,510
[KAZUMA] You say some really
embarrassing stuff sometimes.

475
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:21,010
I guess I do.
I just feel blessed.

476
00:20:21,810 --> 00:20:22,850
Uh-uh?

477
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:25,560
[AQUA] You need to show me
a little more respect!

478
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:28,060
Or, did you already forget
that I resurrected you?

479
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:30,940
Where is the appreciation
I so rightfully deserve?

480
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:32,070
[DUST]
Damn it, Kazuma!

481
00:20:32,230 --> 00:20:34,860
That priest of yours is being
a huge pain in the ass!

482
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:40,780
- [MEGUMIN, AQUA] We're home!
- [KAZUMA] Welcome back!

483
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:44,330
Yo, Darkness! You came
back here pretty early, huh?

484
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:47,290
[MEGUMIN]
Hey, I don't see her anywhere.

485
00:20:47,620 --> 00:20:48,830
[KAZUMA]
Is she in her room?

486
00:20:49,290 --> 00:20:51,500
Well, it's time for a few more
drinky drinks!

487
00:20:51,630 --> 00:20:53,420
Bring Darkness out here
'cause the three of us

488
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:54,420
are gonna empty this bottle!

489
00:20:54,500 --> 00:20:55,550
- [MEGUMIN] Kazuma.
- [BOTH] Huh?

490
00:20:58,090 --> 00:20:59,220
[KAZUMA]
What's this?

491
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:00,680
[AQUA]
Whatcha got there?

492
00:21:01,470 --> 00:21:04,010
"Please forgive me for suddenly
springing this on you."

493
00:21:04,180 --> 00:21:05,510
- Whoa, what the...
- [both gasp]

494
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:07,600
[DARKNESS]
Please forgive me for suddenly

495
00:21:07,770 --> 00:21:08,770
springing this on you.

496
00:21:09,350 --> 00:21:10,350
I am sorry.

497
00:21:10,690 --> 00:21:13,150
But, things have become
rather complex

498
00:21:13,650 --> 00:21:15,110
I realize this is selfish

499
00:21:15,610 --> 00:21:17,360
but I am afraid
I have to leave.

500
00:21:17,650 --> 00:21:19,490
To that end,
I ask that you find

501
00:21:19,570 --> 00:21:21,160
a new frontline fighter
for the group.

502
00:21:21,990 --> 00:21:23,910
I am very grateful
to the three of you.

503
00:21:24,490 --> 00:21:27,750
So much so that I could never
fully express my feelings.

504
00:21:28,290 --> 00:21:31,330
Aqua, Megumin, Kazuma.

505
00:21:32,500 --> 00:21:33,840
