we all spent together

510
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:45,640
will be forever etched
in my memory.

511
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:48,430
Thank you for everything

512
00:21:49,810 --> 00:21:51,690
from Lalatina Dustiness Ford

513
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:56,070
to my beloved companions
with deep gratitude.

514
00:21:58,150 --> 00:21:59,280
